{"articleNo":"233356","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=233356&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 졸업예정자 도서대출 중지 안내(1월21일 부터)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.01.13","hit":"5340","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong>1. 도서관규정 제24조 3항에 의거 졸업예정자는 <font color=\"red\">졸업일 1개월전까지 대출도서를 모두&nbsp; 반납</font>해야 합니다.</strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong>2.&nbsp;졸업예정자는1월 21일 부터 도서대출을 중지합니다. </strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong>3. 졸업예정자 중 본교 대학원 진학자는 등록금 납부 후 영수증을 제시하면 \n도서&nbsp;대출이 가능합니다.</strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong>4. 또한, 대출도서 미 반납 시에는 졸업 후 각종 증명서(졸업증명서, \n성적증명서 등)발급이 중지되오니&nbsp;</strong></font></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong>졸업전에 대출도서를 모두 반납하여&nbsp;주시기 바랍니다</strong>.</font></font></strong></font></font></strong></font></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong>※ 대출중지일: 2020년 1월 \n21일</strong></font></font></font></font></font></strong></font></font></strong></font></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></strong></font></p><p><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Dotum\" size=\"2\"><strong><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Dotum